---
description: >-
  Node labels follow the label rule (#1368): markdown only in a quoted markdown
  string, tags draw, a written \n breaks the line and grows its row; plain
  markdown, bare backticks and a code span are drawn as written, as are file
  names with underscores. Files and directories, quoted and unquoted.
---
treeView-beta
  plain/
    unquoted **bold** _ital_
    "quoted **bold** _ital_"
  "`md dir **bold** _ital_`/"
    "`quoted md **bold** _ital_`"
    '`single md **bold** _ital_`'
  backticks/
    `bare **bold** _ital_`
    code a `code` b
  tags <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i>/
    unquoted <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
    "quoted <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"
  breaks/
    unquoted one\ntwo
    "quoted one\ntwo"
    "`md **one**\ntwo`"
  names/
    my_file_name.spec.ts
    __init__.py
